  "description_text": "Single family restoration opportunity. Potential abounds in this sprawling and rarely available side-by-side 2-family in the heart of Central JP. Owner-occupants and investors, bring your ideas and creativity and re-envision this much-loved family home. Offering 2,881 sq ft with 6+ bedrooms across 3 living levels plus unfinished basements on a 5,814 sq ft lot in a 2F-7000 zone. Merge the units into a stunning and spacious single-family home with possible income producing/in-law/au pair apartment or use the separate entrances to create townhouses. Farmhouse style details, systems updated as needed over time, yard complete with a generous back deck and a shared garage perfect for a studio or workshop space. Convenient on-street permit parking and around the corner from the JP post office, you are moments from Centre Street, the Orange Line, Jamaica Pond, and all that this prime location has to offer.",
