  "description_text": "Attention investors, contractors, developers, and buyers ready to create something special! Opportunity awaits at 21 Green St. in the heart of Jamaica Plain. This single family home offers approximately 1,583 square feet of living space with 4 bedrooms, 1.5 bathrooms and is ready for a complete transformation. The property requires extensive renovations and is being sold strictly as is. Traditional FHA and conventional financing may not be suitable due to the property's condition. Cash buyers and buyers utilizing renovation financing are encouraged to explore this opportunity, subject to lender and property eligibility. Bring your vision, your team and reimagine the possibilities! Conveniently located in Jamaica Plain's Centre St. neighborhood, steps away from shops, restaurants, public transportation, Jamaica Pond and all the amenities this vibrant community has to offer. Buyer and buyer's agent to perform their own due diligence regarding property condition, financing eligibility, permitted uses, and development potential. Any offers due by Wednesday November 18 at 5pm.",
